      "desc": "IAM users granted **Bedrock** permissions are evaluated for recent service usage.\n\nUsers whose last Bedrock access exceeds the configured threshold (default **60 days**) or that have **never** accessed Bedrock are flagged, indicating stale permissions that should be reviewed.",
