    "remediation": {
      "desc": "Enable **MFA** for the root user, preferably **hardware-based** or a dedicated, managed device. Remove root access keys and avoid using root for daily tasks. Apply **least privilege** with IAM Identity Center for admins, and use Organizations to **centralize root access** and eliminate long-lived root credentials.",
      "references": [
        "https://hub.prowler.com/check/iam_root_mfa_enabled"
      ]
    },
    "risk_details": "Without **MFA**, compromise of the root password or access keys can lead to full **account takeover**. An attacker with root can disable protections, steal or delete data, change billing, and create persistent admins, undermining confidentiality, integrity, and availability.",
